#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送、校内放送…
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahem! School announcement, school announcement."
msgstr ""

#. まもなく夜時間となりますが、その前に…
msgctxt "0003 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Nighttime is quickly approaching, but before it\n"
"arrives..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ生徒諸君は、
#. 至急、<CLT 3>体育館<CLT>までお集まりくださーい。
msgctxt "0004 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "All students, please gather in the <CLT 3>gym<CLT> immediately."
msgstr ""

#. えまーじぇんしー、えまーじぇんしー！
msgctxt "0005 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Emergency! Emergency!"
msgstr ""

#. 体育館に集まれ…だって？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Gather in the gym...?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよ急に…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why now all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>嫌な予感がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really don't like the sound of this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もの凄く…嫌な予感が……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have a terrible feeling...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなモニターなんか…
#. 気にしている場合じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about a monitor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで…
#. ボクらを監視してるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They've been using these cameras to watch us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、今は無視するしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's infuriating...but I have to just try and not\n"
"think about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの死から…目を背けちゃいけない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let myself turn away from Sayaka's death...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの為にも…
#. ボク自身の為にもだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For Sayaka...and for myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この鉄板…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This metal plate..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな鉄板で閉じ込められてるなんて…
#. まさに悪夢だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To be sealed in by a huge slab of metal... It's like\n"
"I'm stuck in a bad dream.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. この鉄板…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This metal plate..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな鉄板で閉じ込められてるなんて…
#. まさに悪夢だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To be sealed in by a huge slab of metal... It's like\n"
"I'm stuck in a bad dream.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same notepad from before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は必要ない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't need it for anything right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなクリーナーなんか…
#. 気にしている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about a stupid lint roller.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる工具セット。
#. まだ未開封の新品だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The toolkit is still wrapped in plastic, totally\n"
"unopened.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は寝てる場合じゃないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to sleep right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴミ箱の中なんて
#. 確認してる場合じゃないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to root through the trash can right\n"
"now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. よくある一般的な机だな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same desk with the same few drawers. It's the\n"
"kind of thing any student would have.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0031 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0032 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
